{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-10243", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-10243", "text": "'Bluetooth is turned off'", "sha256": "be8003dafe020b25ca83eb90b091a6454da452ab3bb35c275219e97800cc4283", "kind": "dart", "start": 10243, "end": 10268, "line": 256}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-10278", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-10278", "text": "'The phone’s radio is off, so the band cannot be reached by any app. '\n'The band keeps recording meanwhile; nothing is lost.'", "sha256": "6124b99c90ee68b6e85011144933272b5296566e46a322ddffbeb5116eadc9e5", "kind": "dart", "start": 10278, "end": 10415, "line": 257}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-10430", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-10430", "text": "'Turn Bluetooth on'", "sha256": "60f0048e72152b6fb657bfed3aa24804fd323ac507aeef3998dc64348b6b1e35", "kind": "dart", "start": 10430, "end": 10449, "line": 259}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-10576", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-10576", "text": "'This phone has no Bluetooth Low Energy radio'", "sha256": "e9eea0c1f0e830c76197c26ed603060b0736b1cbd0637017acdc841f344868f1", "kind": "dart", "start": 10576, "end": 10622, "line": 264}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-10632", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-10632", "text": "'The band can only be reached over Bluetooth Low Energy. Imported '\n'data still works; a live link does not.'", "sha256": "06eea64927f475c5547400f67cb54a6f2633f5943ec384b829731801fc873f0c", "kind": "dart", "start": 10632, "end": 10753, "line": 265}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-10891", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-10891", "text": "'Reconnecting has been paused'", "sha256": "e5cc3ed3256bb4678bbd5a0115e91bfb2fa5c9afd82ec43b5c392949124a70af", "kind": "dart", "start": 10891, "end": 10921, "line": 274}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-10929", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-10929", "text": "'The band refused the pairing key $bondRefusals times in a row, so the '\n'app stopped retrying rather than pin the radio and drain both '\n'batteries on a link that will not open. Nothing is reconnecting '\n'until you act.'", "sha256": "1f0cd4cd17f79e1c5e8706af5cb6c28da0c7c2df4ffb88c0773648823fed95a4", "kind": "dart", "start": 10929, "end": 11180, "line": 275}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-11344", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-11344", "text": "'The band needs to be paired again'", "sha256": "616aaa88f099dc4ac06d9ecfe8b4d2741317948f5c838aac16ca1b700f6083c9", "kind": "dart", "start": 11344, "end": 11379, "line": 286}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-11387", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-11387", "text": "'The link comes up, but the band rejects the encryption key the phone '\n'holds, so every command is dropped and no data moves. Your '\n'recordings are safe on the band.'", "sha256": "34ec11afc0f813817d81304792ff445ae64dceca73bf7e3358d06d8f20b437c2", "kind": "dart", "start": 11387, "end": 11575, "line": 287}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-11706", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-11706", "text": "'One batch of recordings will not finish transferring'", "sha256": "ddc492bf8d27f7a6203bb07134d486dfd01535b16d6b59c5dee2e06015732412", "kind": "dart", "start": 11706, "end": 11760, "line": 296}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-11768", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-11768", "text": "'The band keeps re-sending the same batch because the app cannot get '\n'its confirmation through. Everything in it is already saved here — '\n'nothing is lost — but the band cannot move on until the '\n'confirmation lands.'", "sha256": "9f51db9168fac811fd2fb70396ae9584af1a86e256870e5661d66911ca42fff7", "kind": "dart", "start": 11768, "end": 12019, "line": 297}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-12032", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-12032", "text": "'Reconnect the band; if it repeats tomorrow, pair it again'", "sha256": "1ea7e83cae163c99fdb19f30ae66f2efbc5893174e7bbef6088c96b7aff946b8", "kind": "dart", "start": 12032, "end": 12091, "line": 301}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-12204", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-12204", "text": "'The band has stopped handing over its recordings'", "sha256": "cf0ac68fb748ce5c1967b94ab0752de16507e2f6f0e21c56eb7088c82a4b156d", "kind": "dart", "start": 12204, "end": 12254, "line": 307}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-12262", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-12262", "text": "'The band reports newer recordings than it will send. Those recordings '\n'are still on the band and still safe; it just is not passing them '\n'across.'", "sha256": "aa23b2c8b6e86950e8c275411adac426d54fe0047cf44ecde4034ebc55b33386", "kind": "dart", "start": 12262, "end": 12433, "line": 308}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-12446", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-12446", "text": "'Put the band on its charger for a minute, then reconnect'", "sha256": "850075dc6ef28260ec02b4f176470fed1f9093b3f62b3430bb80b7b225269fa8", "kind": "dart", "start": 12446, "end": 12504, "line": 311}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-12606", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-12606", "text": "'Syncs are finishing with no data in them'", "sha256": "2df63c624de878a2e92f13c6b75e6ee65acd814488f159b766c857d226e1a521", "kind": "dart", "start": 12606, "end": 12648, "line": 317}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-12656", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-12656", "text": "'The band completes each sync without handing over a single sensor '\n'reading, which almost always means its onboard clock has lost '\n'sync. The app keeps resetting it on every connect.'", "sha256": "aa65496bed79ee615b2f14a5441772763d107d71f9cff4b957c6f0a1147c7b8a", "kind": "dart", "start": 12656, "end": 12862, "line": 318}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-12875", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-12875", "text": "'Leave the band connected for a few minutes; if nothing arrives '\n'by tomorrow, pair it again'", "sha256": "cf392badc04ba15cdb5e85a5cf1b4cd52430cd4d0972cb61afe97f90fc2f88d3", "kind": "dart", "start": 12875, "end": 12979, "line": 321}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-13131", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-13131", "text": "'The band is linked and handing over its recordings.'", "sha256": "b6d788021462f590e4e4961738752be4d3d376ea79f7e55327d7b5570089f6a4", "kind": "dart", "start": 13131, "end": 13184, "line": 330}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-13313", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-13313", "text": "'Opening the link to the band.'", "sha256": "9678039d946f9835a6a6e667118bd714924c35458107fac4510211ccafdf74a3", "kind": "dart", "start": 13313, "end": 13344, "line": 336}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-13447", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-13447", "text": "'Looking for the band'", "sha256": "017715f13bb8157f353b4d4a3c0a69bf74a18335c0eb8599fb82e1886b92ae3d", "kind": "dart", "start": 13447, "end": 13469, "line": 341}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-13479", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-13479", "text": "'Listening for the band to advertise itself.'", "sha256": "abcae98a6665615e55f0d1f587579e41f439fb2be149a3ac2959bb4cd9a0f50b", "kind": "dart", "start": 13479, "end": 13524, "line": 342}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-13623", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-13623", "text": "'Not connected'", "sha256": "4811d9b5eb7754dcb7fe1c8feadac7f387c4b9cd34c6c36f76c3dfaf67f55691", "kind": "dart", "start": 13623, "end": 13638, "line": 347}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-13648", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-13648", "text": "'The band is out of range, on its charger, or held by another app. '\n'It keeps recording either way.'", "sha256": "a0861c861a98b0c81cc2ea2216d6fb9a578c358546beadeafbc806111554cae0", "kind": "dart", "start": 13648, "end": 13761, "line": 348}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-13776", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-13776", "text": "'Bring the band near the phone, and close any other app '\n'connected to it'", "sha256": "2fbf38f95496783ca243b3c1ed0933ec262ead7f4fca689710547da43e9fd581", "kind": "dart", "start": 13776, "end": 13863, "line": 350}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-51854", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-51854", "text": "'alarm haptic pattern must be 12 bytes'", "sha256": "9e6d725a21698e705535a98d1b7e62096e9e61adcc28460b33384f534cf1af79", "kind": "dart", "start": 51854, "end": 51893, "line": 1183}
{"id": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart:offset-92089", "file": "lib/ble/ble_state.dart", "location": "offset-92089", "text": "'a bounded wait needs the answer it gives when the bound is reached'", "sha256": "63a502eb6bee04b09784c5fe69615b36fc7595c40e591996861dbaadb36e9c9b", "kind": "dart", "start": 92089, "end": 92157, "line": 2142}
