{"id": "lib/ble/hrs_link.dart:offset-25069", "file": "lib/ble/hrs_link.dart", "location": "offset-25069", "text": "'Your main band is not paired yet. Searching for a sensor now starts '\n'Bluetooth in a way that hides the system pairing sheet until you '\n'restart the app — so pair your main band first, or expect to restart '\n'the app before you can.'", "sha256": "4525123b6222d3cf6cc53db043036501bf4f47ffbee670d72bb62d7811e54a54", "kind": "dart", "start": 25069, "end": 25329, "line": 498}
