{"id": "lib/ble/hrs_link.dart:offset-28707", "file": "lib/ble/hrs_link.dart", "location": "offset-28707", "text": "'That sensor did not answer. It may have gone back to sleep, or '\n'it may already be connected to another phone or app.'", "sha256": "74027734a3e67d1a7c10ea1274b2df7472a8364c71b5d6c58864dd4910a39939", "kind": "dart", "start": 28707, "end": 28837, "line": 575}
